---
---

<section id="cases" class="py-20 px-4 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#2C1810] text-center mb-4">精選案例</h2>
    <p class="text-[#8C7B6B] text-center mb-12">實際服務場景，讓您更了解我們</p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <!-- 案例 1: 專業代烤現場 -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm overflow-hidden border border-[#FAF6F1]">
        <img
          src="/images/real/setup.png"
          alt="愛烤PRO 到府代烤現場全套專業設備與烤爐"
          class="w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-t-lg"
        />
        <div class="p-5">
          <h3 class="text-base font-medium text-[#2C1810]">專業代烤現場</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#8C7B6B] mt-1">苗栗縣卓蘭鎮</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#C75B39] mt-1">到府代烤</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#3D2B1F]/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            全套專業烤爐設備與品牌桌布置入，從食材準備到現場烤製，一站式服務讓您完全不用操心。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 案例 2: 大型活動長桌宴 -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm overflow-hidden border border-[#FAF6F1]">
        <img
          src="/images/real/event-table.png"
          alt="愛烤PRO 大型活動長桌烤肉宴席現場"
          class="w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-t-lg"
        />
        <div class="p-5">
          <h3 class="text-base font-medium text-[#2C1810]">大型活動長桌宴</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#8C7B6B] mt-1">苗栗縣各鄉鎮</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#C75B39] mt-1">公司活動 / 團體聚餐</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#3D2B1F]/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            服務大型團體活動，長桌擺滿豐盛烤肉與配菜，專業烤手團隊全程現場服務。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 案例 3: 精緻帶骨小排 -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm overflow-hidden border border-[#FAF6F1]">
        <img
          src="/images/real/lamb-chops.png"
          alt="愛烤PRO 精緻帶骨小排與生菜擺盤"
          class="w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-t-lg"
        />
        <div class="p-5">
          <h3 class="text-base font-medium text-[#2C1810]">精緻帶骨小排</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#8C7B6B] mt-1">精緻方案 / 尊榮方案</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#C75B39] mt-1">食材展示</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#3D2B1F]/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            嚴選帶骨小排搭配新鮮生菜擺盤，專業烤手掌握最佳火候，外酥內嫩肉汁滿溢。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 案例 4: 現場串烤服務 -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm overflow-hidden border border-[#FAF6F1]">
        <img
          src="/images/real/skewers.png"
          alt="愛烤PRO 現場串烤牛肉串、雞軟骨、米血糕"
          class="w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-t-lg"
        />
        <div class="p-5">
          <h3 class="text-base font-medium text-[#2C1810]">現場串烤服務</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#8C7B6B] mt-1">牛肉串 / 雞軟骨 / 米血糕</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#C75B39] mt-1">經典菜單</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#3D2B1F]/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            各式串烤食材現場烤製，牛肉串、雞軟骨、米血糕等經典口味，大人小孩都喜愛。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
